Description: Rates confirmatory factor analysis (CFA) fit indices against the
    COSMIN structural validity criterion "CFI or TLI or comparable measure
    > 0.95 OR RMSEA < 0.06 OR SRMR < 0.08" (Prinsen et al. 2018
    <doi:10.1007/s11136-018-1798-3>; Mokkink et al. 2024) and against
    alternative rules. Handles indices that a study did not report, gives the
    population relation between SRMR and RMSEA, and provides simple
    confidence intervals for proportions of ratings.
